--- task
id: t28
dataset: section8
kind: lexical filter without a score

--- intent
List the titles of documents whose body matches the search text `$s` and also matches the text `$q` allowing up to 2 typos.

--- params
{"s": "search", "q": "rankng"}

--- edition2
query mentions($s: String, $q: String) {
  match { $d: Doc  search($d.body, $s)  fuzzy($d.body, $q, 2) }
  return { $d.title }
}

--- edition3
query mentions($s: String, $q: String) {
  match { $d: Doc  search($d.body, $s)  fuzzy($d.body, $q, max_edits: 2) }
  return { $d.title }
}

--- edition3
query mentions($s: String, $q: String) {
  match { $d: Doc  match_terms($d.body, terms($s, mode: any))  match_terms($d.body, terms($q, mode: any, max_edits: 2)) }
  return { $d.title }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["d.title"]
["The search engine"]

--- note
The asset's `mentions` runs `fuzzy` over `Doc.title`, which its schema does not index (`T27`); the task uses the indexed body.
